        "Logs in 08-tooling/ch11-deck/logs_v4_0_0: code_check (C1 list equals source, C2 one whole code box equal to source, C4 set-up plus code runs: 19 examples, 0 findings); deck_standard_v1_2_0 (13 of 13 PASS; v1.2.0 is a new file that exempts boxes named code from the 30-word limit because a code box is not prose; v1.1.0 stays); overlap, reader_notes, story_prose, fit, layout, notes all clean. The builder's older manifest_selfcheck 2.1.0 runs bare code without the hidden set-up lines, so it reports findings that do not apply to deck 4.0.0; its log is kept and the set-up-aware run is the code check C4 and the page step. The old teaching check 1.0.0 (40 to 60 word notes, reads balloons as code) predates the 2026-11-14 rulings and was not used. C3 (page holds the whole code) waits for the page story." ;
    backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify .

